    <briefdescription>
<para>Serves the Swagger UI page that documents the API. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>GET /api/v2/doc (INSECURE). The HTML is compiled into the binary from docs/api.html at configure time, so no runtime file is required. The handler only constructs the response; there is no request-dependent state. <simplesect kind="see"><para>api_html.hpp (generated header containing docs::kApiHtml) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
